---
title: "Krewire — The Go-First Software Engineering Ecosystem · One Ecosystem. Every Workload."
description: "End-to-end digital SDLC ecosystem in Go — secure, sustainable, scalable. One CLI kiw, one config krewire.yaml, every workload: app, cli, site, book, worker, service, gateway, infra."
layout: Landing
---

