      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4 sm:mb-5 text-fg dark:text-fg-dark" data-i18n="matrix.title">Why Engineers Choose Krewire</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-relaxed" data-i18n="matrix.lead">Compare the simplicity of an all-in-one Go toolchain against fragmented multi-language setups.</p>
